  "text": {
    "title": "Map I: The Border Fords & Weeping Ossuary",
    "body": "From the fortified timber palisades of Thornwick Market, march across six interconnected frontier regions to break High Quartermaster Morvessa's Salt-Tithe cordon, purge the Weeping Ossuary beneath Ravenwatch Keep, and open the southern road to Redmarsh.",
    "obj.0": "Main: Clear Sunken Ford and execute Chieftain Grok'tar (74, 98)",
    "obj.1": "Main: Relight Lantern Passage and slay Malgath, Chanter of the Pyre (96, 162)",
    "obj.2": "Main: Break the siege of Ravenwatch Keep's outer bailey (136, 48)",
    "obj.3": "Main: Descend into the Weeping Ossuary and slay Morvessa, the Silk Widow (168, 20)",
    "obj.4": "Main: Hold Alder Bridge cutwater against the eastern host (138, 96)",
    "obj.5": "Main: Breach Ashbrook Southern Gatehouse and defeat Commander Vaelen (172, 174)",
    "obj.6": "Side: Audit the Burned Border Mint ruins for Assayer Pell's scales (34, 30)",
    "obj.7": "Side: Harvest Vitrified Slag shards from the Old Kilns and slay Krazak (42, 36)",
    "obj.8": "Side: Liberate Greywood Sawmill and slay Skara, Matron of Frostquills (62, 38)",
    "obj.9": "Side: Hunt Thornmaw the Ironroot in the Craghorn Granite Quarry (162, 114)",
    "obj.10": "Side: Burn the Lower-Parish Probate Lien-Roll in the Sunken Scriptorium (152, 32)",
    "obj.11": "Side: Relieve water pressure behind Gallery Four in the Undervault Links (134, 152)",
    "msg.1": "Look at the driftwood wedged against the weir, Commander. Those aren't peasant hay-carts—those are Border Mint bullion wagons burned down to the iron axle-trees. Secure Sunken Ford first, then push into the marsh and the northern timber depots.",
    "msg.1.who": "Warden Hale",
    "msg.2": "Sunken Ford is held! Recovered toll ledgers confirm Grok'tar was paid in stamped Border Mint copper to destroy tax records before Oakhaven auditors arrived.",
    "msg.2.who": "Ford-Scout Bren",
    "msg.3": "Malgath's pyre-chanters lie broken in Lantern Passage. The whale-oil beacons burn bright blue once more above the peat sinks.",
    "msg.3.who": "Warden Hale",
    "msg.4": "Ravenwatch Keep's outer courtyard is secured and the bone totems lie shattered. The subterranean stair into the Weeping Ossuary yawns open before us.",
    "msg.4.who": "Orlen",
    "msg.5": "Morvessa's brass abacus clatters into the ash of the Ossuary! We have recovered her Border Mint Seal Ring and the stolen southern bullion waybills.",
    "msg.5.who": "Orlen",
    "msg.6": "Alder Bridge stands unbroken! Three thousand river-parish refugees have safely crossed the granite arches toward the southern road.",
    "msg.6.who": "Warden Hale",
    "msg.7": "Ashbrook Gatehouse is ours and Siege Commander Vaelen has fallen! The southern road into the Desiccated Marches of Redmarsh lies open.",
    "msg.7.who": "Warden Hale",
    "msg.8": "Assayer Pell's assay scales and the Clipped Coin Investigation ledger have been recovered from the burned Border Mint vaults.",
    "msg.8.who": "Reeve Marlow",
    "msg.9": "Krazak the Volt Stalker is slain! Three translucent green shards of Vitrified Slag have been harvested from the kiln heaps.",
    "msg.9.who": "High Arcanist Vaelen",
    "msg.10": "Skara lies dead among the sawdust and the iron crowbars have been pried from Greywood's water-wheel!",
    "msg.10.who": "Captain Merrick",
    "msg.11": "Thornmaw the Ironroot has crumbled into inert quarry granite! The moorland packs scatter into the crags.",
    "msg.11.who": "Ford-Scout Bren",
    "msg.12": "The gall-ink probate register burns to cinders on the scriptorium lectern. Miller Tobin and the indebted dead of the lower parish are finally released.",
    "msg.12.who": "Orlen",
    "msg.13": "The bronze pressure wheel in Undervault Gallery Four turns free, draining the meltwater and exposing the hidden tax-commission silver!",
    "msg.13.who": "Warden Hale",
    "npc.hale": "Hold the river crossings and keep your powder dry, Commander. If Alder Bridge falls, three northern parishes die in the mud.",
    "npc.marlow": "Someone burned the Border Mint six winters ago to hide shaved silver groats. Bring me Assayer Pell's ledger from the northern ruins and Thornwick's treasury will reward you.",
    "npc.miller": "Morvessa's irregulars hamstrung our draft-oxen and wedged iron crowbars into the Greywood sawmill wheel. Clear the canopy and free the mill!",
    "npc.bren": "Grok'tar holds the eastern gravel bar at Sunken Ford, and green marsh-lights are luring turf-cutters off the boardwalks in Fenwick's Peat.",
    "npc.orlen": "Beneath Ravenwatch Keep lies the Weeping Ossuary. Morvessa's probate clerks bound the dead in gall-ink and fed the unpaid tax-rolls to the Silk Widow.",
    "win": "The Border Fords and the Weeping Ossuary are cleansed. Your vanguard marches south toward Redmarsh Outpost.",
    "fail.1": "Your hero has fallen in the mud of the northern frontier."
  }
}
